- **Data Structures:** Enhance the classes to include methods for checking for data integrity before creating or updating records. This could lead to cleaner and more maintainable code.

By addressing these areas, the overall functionality and user experience of the Travel_Log application can be significantly improved while adhering to the architecture principles outlined above.
